# PORT1TO1_PLAN — full 1:1 Cossacks 3 donor port (singleplayer skirmish)

Date: 2026-11-26  
Rule: no approximations, no synthetic assets/noise, no invented constants, no weakened tests, no parity claim without a donor GPU A/B frame. Donor binaries are read-only and never executed. Network/multiplayer is OUT OF SCOPE. All prior user modifications are preserve-only.

Status legend: DONE = landed with evidence/backups; DOING = active worker; TODO = queued; BLOCKED = needs runtime/GPU experiment.

